-- 登记: D5-ctl-pjoi-free | 语义: 把没有梁认领的那只主关节的 DELP 写回 0
-- expected_net: cancelled | restore 搭档: 本文件是 joint/ctl_pjoi_free_apply.mac 的 restore | 库: db8000
-- 写的是绝对值，重跑幂等。期望与 apply 对称：只重建 JFREE 一件。
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-CTL-PJOI-FREE-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-B-JFREE
Q REF
Q NAME
Q TYPE
Q DELP
Q POS WRT /*
DELP E 0 N 0 U 0
Q DELP
Q CREF
Q POS WRT /*
Q ORI WRT /*
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-B-F1-N2-J1
Q REF
Q NAME
Q CREF
Q DELP
Q POS WRT /*
Q ORI WRT /*
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-B-F1-S4
Q REF
Q NAME
Q POSS
Q POSE
Q JOIS
Q JOIE
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite T2 joint/ctl_pjoi_free restore: unclaimed PJOI DELP -> 0'
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-CTL-PJOI-FREE-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
